# Cloudflare Pages：仅为「内容稳定、无 hash」的静态资源加长缓存，不碰 HTML 与 SPA 路径，避免影响发版与路由
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/pdf.worker.min.mjs
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/pdf.worker.min.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/cmaps/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/standard_fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/favicon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
